{{High Risk}}
{{Lua|Item}}
{{CSS|Gadget-Item}}
This template creates the icon and link for an [[item]].

==Syntax==
This template has 2 unnamed parameters:
* {{F|1}} &mdash; Name of the item. If set to Unknown no link is set. '''''Mandatory'''''
* {{F|2}} &mdash; Size of the icon. Default {{F|40}}.
* {{F|link}} &mdash; Sets another page to be linked.
* {{F|text}} &mdash; Displays another text instead of the name of the item.
* {{F|notext}} &mdash; Set to {{F|1}} to omit the complete text. The picture will no longer behave like an inline-block.
* {{F|blueprint}} &mdash; Set to {{F|1}} to display the blueprint icon in the top-left corner.
* {{F|count}} / {{F|x}} &mdash; Quantity of the item. Part of the text.
* {{F|note}} &mdash; Displays the input as a note after the item text and count.
* {{F|type}} &mdash; Keyword to determine the file's suffix and prefix:
** {{F|Item}} ''Default''
** {{F|Enemy}}
** {{F|Wildlife}}
** {{F|Outfit}}
** {{F|Book}}
** {{F|Weapon}}
** {{F|Character}}
* {{F|white}} &mdash; Set to {{F|1}} to add the "White" suffix to file name.
* {{F|ref}} &mdash; Append a reference to the item text.
* {{F|comma}} &mdash; Append a comma to the item text following AmE rules.
* {{F|dot}} &mdash; Append a dot to the item text following AmE rules.
* {{F|commaspc}} &mdash; Append a comma and a space to the item text following AmE rules.
* {{F|dotspc}} &mdash; Append a dot and a space to the item text following AmE rules.

==Examples==
{{T|Item|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Unknown|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Mora|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Small Lamp Grass|p2=20|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Small Lamp Grass|p2=80|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Small Lamp Grass|p2=link=Flora|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Small Lamp Grass|p2=text=Not Lamp Grass|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Small Lamp Grass|p2=notext=1|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Alchemist's Crafting Bench|p2=blueprint=1|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Open-Air Workshop|p2=20|p3=blueprint=1|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Primogem|p2=x=20|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Small Lamp Grass|p2=x=2|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Dull Blade|p2=type=Weapon|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Rex Incognito|p2=type=Book|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Lisa|p2=type=Character|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Inazuma|p2=type=Emblem|p3=white=1|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Missing File|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Missing File|p2=80|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Canned Knowledge "Swordfighting Techniques VIII"|_Ybr_=1}}<br>
{{T|Item|p1=Canned Knowledge "Swordfighting Techniques VIII"|p2=comma=1|_Ybr_=1}}

